==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:A Brewing Darkness]] in order to do [[Quest:A Sweetwater Climb]].

==To Start==
Speak with [[Chugzy]] located in near the [[Wugachug]] [[Warpstone]].

==Goals==
Do what needs to be done in order to participate in the Chug-a-Mug Challenge.
*Talk to [[Guard Thoomlug]]
*Complete [[Sweetwater Climb]]
*Return to Guard Thoomlug

==Steps==
#Speak with [[Chugzy]] located in near the Wugachug Warpstone.

{{Quote|The Chug-a-Mug Challenge is the most prestigious event for Wugachug and their Sasparilla Festival!<br />Hey, you should join the contest! Nothing quenches your thirst like a mug of Sweetwater Sasparilla! And I know that we, err, you adventuring types work up quite a thirst during your adventures.|Chugzy}}

#Speak with Guard Thoomlug found in front of the Party Tent in Wugachug.

{{Quote|Ruined! The festival is ruined! We always start the challenge with a fresh mug brewed right here in the Party Tent, but we can't continue because our Sweetwater isn't sweet!<br />Grah! I bet those bixies are at it again!"|Guard Thoomlug}}

{{Quote|Oh no!|Player response}}

{{Quote|All of my guards are keeping the peace around town with the festival in full swing, but you look like you can hold your own in a fight!<br />Make your way to the top of Sweetwater Climb and put a stop to their tampering!|Guard Thoomlug}}

#Complete the Sweetwater Climb [[Dungeons|dungeon]] that can be found behind the Wugachug Brewery.
#Speak with Guard Thoomlug found in front of the Party Tent in Wugachug.

{{Quote|From what I hear, the Brewmasters of Wugachug are again able to create their award-winning Sweetwater Sasparilla.<br />With your help, they should be able to start the Chug-a-Mug Challenge in no time!|Guard Thoomlug}}
